# Names only. Do not put secret values in this file.
# Set them on the Worker with:
#   npx wrangler secret put RESEND_API_KEY
#   npx wrangler secret put CONTACT_EMAIL
# RESEND_API_KEY is the Resend API key.
# CONTACT_EMAIL is the inbox that receives the form.
# The sender is Resend's shared onboarding address, so CONTACT_EMAIL has to be
# the address on that Resend account until a domain is verified there.
# Do not add a new Resend sending domain for this site.
